   "text": "the same views as Report (asked 261104): ⚙️ Process when it has a step, then 📊 Results by the same code;\nred: a reviewed design no ask overruled, kept as a proposal; every section starts closed (▸), its state word on its right, a waiting line under one that waits on you; what it opens to is drawn under its bar, behind a dashed line;\neach view's 🙋 Interaction holds its own forms; the right rail ends Skills · Files, as live (261106)",
